The change belongs in the Modal adapter. `reef/execution/sandbox/modal.py` has no stdin handling anywhere. `ModalSession.launch` (lines 245-286) calls `self.sandbox.exec(...)` and then waits on the process without closing its standard input, which matches the reported hang. The local executor already does the equivalent with `stdin=subprocess.DEVNULL` in `reef/execution/processes.py:272`, which is the reference behavior to match. Nothing else needs to change for this fix. I did not write the change.

